"""Worked instances of every round-6 kind (kinds_r4.py / brute_r4.py).  verify_bank.py --selftest solves each with kinds.py and with brute.py and requires
exactly one answer, equal in both.  EXAMPLES (below) are the example puzzles of the new sub-structures: the wording a puzzle would use, the answer and the
sample it is built on; none is in a released month and none is a puzzle of January to October.  --selftest checks every EXAMPLES answer against the
independent checker as well."""
